Third-party component: CTAB-GAN+
================================

The contents of this directory are a locally-modified copy of CTAB-GAN+:

  Upstream:  https://github.com/Team-TUD/CTAB-GAN-Plus
  Paper:     Zhao et al., "CTAB-GAN+: Enhancing Tabular Data Synthesis",
             arXiv:2204.00401  (https://arxiv.org/abs/2204.00401)

It is redistributed here, with local modifications, solely to reproduce the
experiments in this repository.

Local modifications relative to upstream
-----------------------------------------
- `CTABGAN.__init__` exposes `lr` and `batch_size` (upstream exposes only
  `epochs`) and no longer reads a CSV path at construction time.
- `CTABGAN.fit` accepts a DataFrame and `test_ratio` directly.
- `CTABGANSynthesizer.fit` accepts `lr` and `batch_size`.
